WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.400
<i>Jun22012|0110AM<i>
<b>RANUGAL</b>

1
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:30.400
<i><b>Chelyabinsk Province - Rusia</i></b>

2
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.420
<b>WARNING!</b>
<i><b>Military Zone.</b></i>
<i><b>Closed Area.</b></i>
(Shooting prohibited!)

3
00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.240
- Can we go faster?
- Not on these fucking roads.

4
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.920
Where are you from?
You're not a local.

5
00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.640
I'm paying you to drive, not to chat.

6
00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:33.440
- How much longer?
- Just over those hills.

7
00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:39.260
Crap.

8
00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.500
Dimitri, what did you bring us today?

9
00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.860
My brothers, it's the same old thing.

10
00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:03.700
It's been a slow season.

11
00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.290
Get out of the truck, Dimitri.

12
00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:16.150
Come on!

13
00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:20.470
- Who is he?
- He's my cousin, Lev.

14
00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.630
Why haven't you
mentioned him before?

15
00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.670
Let's see what
you have in the back.

16
00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:29.590
You Stay... in the truck.
Hands still!

17
00:02:31.953 --> 00:02:33.103
Move on, Dimitri.

18
00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:34.510
Alright.

19
00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:35.841
Relax.

20
00:02:36.458 --> 00:02:37.362
Keep moving!

21
00:02:39.996 --> 00:02:40.962
Open it!

22
00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.990
Come on, Dimitri.

23
00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:47.734
Come on!

24
00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:58.310
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!
Who are you guys?

25
00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.580
- What's he saying?
- He wants to know who we are.

26
00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.900
- We're fucking salesmen.
- Better keep moving.

27
00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:08.320
- I'm done. You didn't tell me.
- Listen sweetie.

28
00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.500
Either you get behind the whell, or i do.

29
00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.980
If you do, maybe you'll get your truck back.

30
00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.170
- Get it?
- Got it.

31
00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.460
Good man. Let's move it!

32
00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:47.200
<b>ALPHA</b>
<i>TOM CLANCYS GHOST RECON</i>

33
00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.620
<b>Sub by:</b><i> Ranugal</i>

34
00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:55.760
Sir.

35
00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:58.190
Bring it in boys.

36
00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:04.260
The military base was
decommissioned last year,

37
00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.500
but Sokolov is still the CEO.

38
00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:11.420
They're in two sets of
blocking positions. Here and here.

39
00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:13.410
OK... 

40
00:04:15.180 --> 00:03:16.590
That's our "Boy".

41
00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.860
Wait a minute.
There were three SUV's.

42
00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:26.100
Advance party is clearing,
Shevchenko is hanging back.

43
00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:36.660
- I got security, 30K you're on me?
- Yes sir.

44
00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:38.680
- Pepper, I need you up top.
- Roger that.

45
00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.640
- Chuck.
- Roger, spotting Pep.

46
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.380
Let's move!

47
00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.290
Shevchenko won't be far behind.

48
00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:07.100
Target_1: Autopilot

49
00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.420
Come on! Come on! Faster.

50
00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:28.840
Target_1: Autopilot

51
00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.580
Heads up, Sokolov is in the house.

52
00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:17.260
Roger that, keep moving.

53
00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:51 ,01
Target inbound, 30 seconds.

54
00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:52.300
Copy.

55
00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.210
- Is this Boris?
- Yes.

56
00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:21.900
Come on, bring it over.

57
00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.700
- You're on.
- Go!

58
00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:35.900
Freeze.

59
00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.020
OK.

60
00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.260
Go!

61
00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:45.380
Clear to engage.

62
00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.180
"Scout" inbound.

63
00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:02.340
Sick'em boy.

64
00:08:33.856 --> 00:08:35.736
OK. Talk to me!

65
00:08:37.416 --> 00:08:42.296
- You got eyes on Sokolov?
- Check.

66
00:08:43.056 --> 00:08:46.516
- Shevchenko?
- Negative.

67
00:09:09.736 --> 00:09:11.536
What the hell is that?

68
00:09:24.896 --> 00:09:26.776
I don't know what
the hell they're doing.

69
00:09:27.336 --> 00:09:29.496
Where is he?

70
00:09:29.676 --> 00:09:32.476
- He's coming.
- He's coming?

71
00:09:36.096 --> 00:09:37.976
<i>Tangiers</i>
<i>worked out very well for us.</i>

72
00:09:38.296 --> 00:09:40.216
<i>Everyone thinks,</i>
<i>it was the government.</i>

73
00:09:40.536 --> 00:09:42.376
<i>No one trusts anyone anymore.</i>

74
00:09:42.776 --> 00:09:46.256
<i>My assets are in place,</i>
<i>I need the package.</i>

75
00:09:46.456 --> 00:09:48.136
- He's coming.
- Is he coming or not?

76
00:09:48.336 --> 00:09:52.416
- Yes!
- That's it. The deal is off!
Understand?

77
00:09:52.426 --> 00:09:54.256
Cancel it! Take it back!
Take it back all!

78
00:09:54.456 --> 00:09:56.256
Wait, Wait you!

79
00:10:02.296 --> 00:10:03.176
<i>The city has already been chosen.</i>

80
00:10:04.576 --> 00:10:07.136
<i>You have ten minutes before</i>
<i>we clean the entire area.</i>

81
00:10:07.336 --> 00:10:09.856
- <i>Get what I want.</i>
- I always do.

82
00:10:14.816 --> 00:10:19.336
- On target.
- Holding... holding.

83
00:10:21.356 --> 00:10:22.696
Chuck? What you got?

84
00:10:24.456 --> 00:10:26.336
Positive.
On Shevchenko.

85
00:10:27.396 --> 00:10:30.236
- Fuck it.
- No shot.

86
00:10:30.356 --> 00:10:32.156
Show me my money.

87
00:10:33.476 --> 00:10:35.436
Here is...your money.

88
00:10:36.156 --> 00:10:38.036
You can buy an army, general.

89
00:10:38.556 --> 00:10:40.436
I already have an army.

90
00:10:42.636 --> 00:10:44.436
Open it.

91
00:10:48.397 --> 00:10:50.317
- Shit!
- Oh man!

92
00:10:52.037 --> 00:10:54.237
- Cut "Scout's" mic!
- Cut it now!

93
00:10:54.877 --> 00:10:58.217
Something's down there.
I've got acoustic interference,

94
00:10:58.277 --> 00:11:00.357
there's something, jamming
the whole signal source.

95
00:11:01.117 --> 00:11:03.077
It's as strong as hell whatever it is.

96
00:11:04.277 --> 00:11:06.077
Let "Scout" take a peek.

97
00:11:06.957 --> 00:11:08.797
Here we go.

98
00:11:16.177 --> 00:11:17.957
Holy shit.

99
00:11:19.677 --> 00:11:21.597
We've got a "Bulava" war-head.

100
00:11:21.997 --> 00:11:25.437
Six heads, 150 kilotons a piece.

101
00:11:25.637 --> 00:11:27.757
We got a loose fuckin' nuke.

102
00:11:34.557 --> 00:11:36.397
<i>WARNING!</i>
<i>Arm of Charge</i>
<i>Yes__No</i>

103
00:11:38.797 --> 00:11:40.877
OK, let's get it on.

104
00:11:51.157 --> 00:11:52.997
OK, we have a deal.

105
00:11:53.957 --> 00:11:55.757
Traitor!

106
00:11:58.877 --> 00:12:00.717
Get the car!

107
00:12:01.917 --> 00:12:04.117
- We got them both.
- We're out of here!

108
00:12:04.227 --> 00:12:08.377
Stay put. Neutralize the area,
we've gotta get to that weapon.

109
00:12:28.677 --> 00:12:30.677
- Two in the SUV.
- Your call.

110
00:13:07.157 --> 00:13:07.637
Shit.

111
00:13:09.597 --> 00:13:12.197
All right. We've gonna secure that Nuke.

112
00:13:12.437 --> 00:13:16.377
- Chuck, can you neutralize that fuckin' thing?
- We're gonna find out.

113
00:13:18.497 --> 00:13:19.637
Moving in.

114
00:13:39.317 --> 00:13:42.597
Hey, you! Drop your weapon!
Drop the weapon!

115
00:13:44.377 --> 00:13:46.757
- Get out!
- Don't shoot!

116
00:13:50.037 --> 00:13:52.037
Pepper, keep an
eye on the North gate.

117
00:13:56.457 --> 00:13:57.757
Ssshit!

118
00:13:58.357 --> 00:14:01.347
- You ever done this before?
- Sure,

119
00:14:03.557 --> 00:14:05.317
that was an American nuke,

120
00:14:05.917 --> 00:14:07.437
and it was a simulator.

121
00:14:08.167 --> 00:14:10.727
Everybody, everybody! Get together!
On your knees.

122
00:14:10.927 --> 00:14:12.647
- OK!
- Who else?

123
00:14:12.847 --> 00:14:14.687
Who else didn't come out?

124
00:14:19.427 --> 00:14:21.007
There's something out there.

125
00:14:22.687 --> 00:14:24.527
Get back!

126
00:14:29.367 --> 00:14:31.247
Holly shit!

127
00:14:33.207 --> 00:14:34.767
What the fuck... is that?

128
00:14:42.247 --> 00:14:43.847
We got to get this
thing, stay away from the nuke.

129
00:14:47.367 --> 00:14:49.327
- Chuck.
- Yes...

130
00:14:49.807 --> 00:14:52.287
- ...and this is the honey pot!
- The PU-239!

131
00:14:52.487 --> 00:14:54.287
- What?
- That's one...

132
00:14:54.487 --> 00:14:56.287
five more to go.

133
00:15:00.927 --> 00:15:04.127
I got nine, ten... inbound.
Cloaked and loaded.

134
00:15:05.727 --> 00:15:07.567
They got flankers!

135
00:15:08.727 --> 00:15:11.887
- Stay on that weapon. Pepper, cover him.
- Roger that.

136
00:15:16.207 --> 00:15:18.127
<i>Menu->>Scan->>Scanning:</i>
<i>Unknown...</i>

137
00:16:01.147 --> 00:16:01.627
Shit!

138
00:16:04.477 --> 00:16:07.837
This thing is slow,
once it clocks you, head south.

139
00:16:22.037 --> 00:16:24.257
- Four to go!
- Hey, Boss!

140
00:16:24.347 --> 00:16:26.277
This thing ain't so slow!

141
00:16:42.197 --> 00:16:43.837
Reloading!

142
00:16:44.037 --> 00:16:47.857
- 30K! Get that thing to the canal!
- I'm trying!

143
00:17:08.777 --> 00:17:11.107
Where the fuck are you, Chief?

144
00:17:21.197 --> 00:17:23.157
God damn it! Where are you?

145
00:17:33.397 --> 00:17:37.037
- How much longer god damn it!
- Two left.

146
00:17:49.637 --> 00:17:51.757
Chuck is down.

147
00:17:53.997 --> 00:17:57.237
- What?
- Chuck is down.

148
00:18:01.117 --> 00:18:02.297
- You know what to do.
- Fuck!

149
00:18:20.117 --> 00:18:20.797
Sorry Pal!

150
00:18:32.417 --> 00:18:34.137
<i>Engine->>Weapon->>Scan</i>
<i>->>Search program</i>

151
00:19:00.197 --> 00:19:01.617
I'm at the rendez-vous point.

152
00:19:02.317 --> 00:19:03.517
We got them all!

153
00:19:53.237 --> 00:19:59.157
TO BE CONTINUED

